    "updated_at": "2015-12-14T13:24:15Z",
    "body": "Just re-found this. I'd love to move forward. Here's what I'd appreciate:\n- Proposed spec text that is better. I think you have some in your OP.\n- Data on how many browser engines the current spec text matches (I believe zero?), and on how many browser engines your proposed spec text matches (?).\n- If it's possible with a third set of spec text (besides current and proposed) to match more browsers than with the proposed spec text, then please let us know about this third set of text, and discuss why your proposal is better than the one that is closer to interop. (This might not be the case, but I want to check!)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
