    "created_at": "2016-05-26T13:51:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-26T13:51:09Z",
    "body": "Agreed that we should not do the Edge model. I think the text you suggested is reasonable, I think it would be even better if we defined this in terms of some document-wide pointer, that is set/cleared on navigation. And CSS defines matching in terms of that pointer.\n",
